{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13742","headline":"行路难三首 三 · 顾况","name":"行路难三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见古人烧水银，变作北邙山上尘。\n藕丝挂在虚空中，欲落不落愁杀人。\n睢水英雄多血刃，建章宫阙成煨烬。\n淮王身死桂树折，徐福一去音书绝。\n行路难，行路难，生死皆由天。\n秦皇汉武遭不脱，汝独何人学神仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13742.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13742","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}